# Sentinel detection content (design doc Phase 2 Step 9 / Phase 7 Step 8). The
# module ships 2 default rules (Palo Alto CEF-forwarding-stopped, critical
# threat) via include_default_rules. Everything below is IDENTITY / PRIVILEGED
# ACCESS detection content that must be added explicitly - it does not exist
# until it is enabled here. Validate each query against the tenant's connected
# tables (AuditLogs, SigninLogs, AzureActivity) before promoting from "Alert
# only" to "create_incident = true" in production, per the report-only-first
# principle used for Conditional Access.
#
